<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Token Radar — pre-token protocols ranked by implied value</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">make.fun &middot; token-radar-01 &middot; snapshot <span id="asOf">&mdash;</span></p>
    <h1>Token Radar</h1>
    <p class="lede">Every protocol in the sealed DefiLlama snapshot that records no token
    and is not a wrapped, staked or bridged product of one that trades &mdash;
    ranked by what its token would be worth if its record stayed as it is.</p>
    <p class="note">Implied value is this radar&rsquo;s own claim, from the snapshot&rsquo;s
    figures alone. It is not a launch prediction: nothing here says whether or
    when a protocol issues a token.</p>
  </div>
